  "description": "Two teams of three line up outside the blue line, one by each side boards. On the whistle, each team skates a lap of the face-off circle on its side and comes back out around a pylon. The coach dumps a puck in toward the net and the two teams play 3 on 3 until someone scores. Change how they skate the circle every time: forwards, backwards, or turning from forwards to backwards.",
